water    lake  level 0  waves 0.01  ripples 0.25  catspaws 2
bankside reeds 2  lilies 1.2  duckweed 1  patch -7 -10 3.2  patch 6 -13 3.6  patch 0 -21 5
watermist 1
pondlife ducks 1  at 0 -9  radius 3  young 5
pondlife heron  at -5 -9  toward 80
